cff-version: 1.2.0
title: hfpclawer
message: "If you use hfpclawer in academic work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Li Shen"
repository-code: "https://github.com/diamond2nv/hfpapers-crawler"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/hfpclawer/"
version: 0.19.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A local-first command-line tool for academic literature: multi-source paper search,
  CN-aware full-text fetching with a TCP/QUIC transport ladder and hash-audited downloads,
  a SQLite paper store with an explicit verification state machine, citation-graph
  exploration, local-only recommendations, and an MCP server for agent integration.
keywords:
  - academic literature
  - paper search
  - arXiv
  - QUIC
  - Zotero
  - MCP
  - research tooling
  - command-line
